    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们分享十一在冰岛的旅行经历，包括我们经历的一些抓马意外情况，并分享旅途的高光时刻，也为没有去过想去冰岛的朋友提供真实的反馈！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 穿衣必备冲锋衣、冲锋裤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a> 国泰航空让我们感受什么叫冰火两重天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 这辈子第一次遇见航司宣布破产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> 抓马的行李大BUG</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a> 出国购买机票需谨慎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a> 我们的冰岛追光之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">30:29</a> 冰岛必备特异功能-扎马步！（特产：飓风）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a> 绝美风景之彩虹瀑布及蓝色秘境瀑布</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FntCnqqmJ8nHWSWPLqHsK2QPU6ou.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgzz7IyrvtH4IYylKhTNcfvCz0vj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg1TwTZFQBE36lIGvO_EYxw6A8ul.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgf5UWhDo-GTqBRLXWz6D9iXF7rN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpwYi4x7b48_1CDEPBsrVPyff-qz.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhRmf5UplirDMwQk-9J29nl-xzpL.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr8GYyMJHvtKlqIDgXmP2zwW_Dqr.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
